12	// independently — the real implementation dedupes via a module-level
13	// closure that would otherwise leak state across tests. `invariant` and
14	// `devInvariant` are NOT mocked: their real implementations interpolate
15	// `%s` and throw without the build-time transform, so tests exercise the
16	// shipped behavior directly.
